    <string name="help">Help</string>
    <string name="help_title">How it works</string>
    <string name="help_body">1. Create a routine with the tasks you do before leaving and how long each one takes.\n2. Tap Start: the app works out when you should begin and schedules the alerts.\n3. When each period ends, a short sound plays. There is nothing to dismiss.\n4. When you finish a task, tap Done! so the app can tell if you are on time, ahead or behind.\n\nTip: use Start without saving to try a routine once without keeping it.</string>

